>Q5ZZI9 name=darP | gene=darP;lpg0021 | locus=lpg0021 | protein_name=Dual-action ribosomal maturation protein DarP | organism=Legionella pneumophila subsp. pneumophila (strain Philadelphia 1 / ATCC 33152 / DSM 7513) | taxid=272624 | reviewed=false | evidence=experimentally_supported | evidence_reference=https://doi.org/10.1038/s44320-024-00076-z | source=UniProt;Pathogens3D | annotation=Member of a network of 50S ribosomal subunit biogenesis factors which assembles along the 30S-50S interface, preventing incorrect 23S rRNA structures from forming. Promotes peptidyl transferase center (PTC) maturation / Pathogens3D: Homologous to YjgA-like protein - a biogenesis factor from E.coli solved in complex with its ribosome.
