>Q5ZVR3 name=rsfS | gene=rsfS;lpg1377 | locus=lpg1377 | protein_name=Ribosomal silencing factor RsfS | organism=Legionella pneumophila subsp. pneumophila (strain Philadelphia 1 / ATCC 33152 / DSM 7513) | taxid=272624 | reviewed=false | evidence=experimentally_supported | evidence_reference=https://doi.org/10.1038/s44320-024-00076-z | source=UniProt;Pathogens3D | annotation=Functions as a ribosomal silencing factor. Interacts with ribosomal protein uL14 (rplN), blocking formation of intersubunit bridge B8. Prevents association of the 30S and 50S ribosomal subunits and the formation of functional ribosomes, thus repressing translation / Pathogens3D: Ribosomal silencing factor RsfS
